#* {{quote-journal|en|date=2012-12-14| author=w:Simon Jenkins| title=We mustn't overreact to North Korea boys' toys| volume=188| issue=2| page=23| magazine=w:The Guardian Weekly| url=http://www.guardian.co.uk/commentisfree/2012/dec/14/north-korea-boys-toys-threat-reaction| passage=David Cameron insists that his latest communications data '''bill''' is “vital to counter terrorism”. Yet terror is mayhem. It is no threat to freedom. That threat is from counter-terror, from ministers capitulating to securocrats.|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20261013204838/https://www.theguardian.com/commentisfree/2012/dec/14/north-korea-boys-toys-threat-reaction|archivedate=13 October 2026}}
