#: {{co|en|a hair and '''beauty''' salon}}
#* {{quote-text|en|year=2013|author=Bethany Rooney; Mary Lou Belli|title=Directors Tell the Story|page=184
|passage=When the '''beauty''' team departs the set, the AD will say, “Let’s go [[on a bell]].” A bell sounds throughout the stage, and {{...}}}}
# {{lb|en|obsolete}} Prevailing style or taste; rage; fashion.
#* {{RQ:Taylor Twenty-five Sermons|subtitle=Sermon XVIII. [The Marriage Ring; or, The Mysteriousness and Duties of Marriage.] Part II.|page=277|passage={{w|Menander}} in the comedy brings in a man turning his wife from his house, because she stained her hair yellow, which was then the '''beauty'''.}}
