##: {{ux|en|Shut your '''beak'''!}}
##* {{quote-book|en|author=w:Joseph O'Connor|title=The Salesman|location=London|publisher=w:Secker & Warburg|year=1998|page=43|pageurl=https://archive.org/details/salesman00ocon/page/43/mode/1up|isbn=0-436-20265-4|passage='Did you think that bloody question up by yourself, pal?' Seánie snapped, and the guy opened and closed his '''beak''' a few times — I suppose he must have been surprised that a priest would talk like that.}}
